# The SHA-256 of every file the Makefile downloads, by URL, which
# test/fetch.sh checks each download against.  The Maven artifacts were
# checked against Maven Central's .sha1 files when recorded, and the GitHub
# release assets against the digests GitHub lists for them; GitHub publishes
# none for a tag's source archive (SIMDe).

